1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,899
Lucia bought the last crossing, then
watched the ferryman sell the same

2
00:00:04,899 --> 00:00:06,940
two seats to somebody else.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:11,022
The other passengers carried luggage.
Jason carried an envelope that

4
00:00:11,022 --> 00:00:13,880
suddenly felt much too heavy for paper.

5
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:18,772
Lucia checked the timetable. The last
boat had left before they arrived.

6
00:00:18,772 --> 00:00:20,810
This one was staying tied.

7
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:24,892
Across the creek, headlights appeared
between trees. Their anonymous buyer

8
00:00:24,892 --> 00:00:27,750
had chosen a meeting with no exit.

9
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:32,649
Jason reached for the money. Lucia
reached for the waiting family's bags

10
00:00:32,649 --> 00:00:34,690
and carried them back uphill.

11
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:38,359
The buyer flashed his lights, impatient.
Jason finally understood:

12
00:00:38,359 --> 00:00:41,620
witnesses were supposed to leave on that
boat.

13
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:46,111
Lucia handed their fare to the family.
Everyone waited together beneath

14
00:00:46,111 --> 00:00:48,560
the shelter until the headlights
vanished.

15
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:53,812
At sunrise, the real ferry arrived. They
crossed without the deal. Jason

16
00:00:53,812 --> 00:00:56,000
called the lost money cheap.
